# ABP Blob Storage

## Using Blob Container
```csharp
public class MyService : ITransientDependency
{
    private readonly IBlobContainer _blobContainer;

    public MyService(IBlobContainer blobContainer)
    {
        _blobContainer = blobContainer;
    }

    public async Task SaveAsync(byte[] content, string fileName)
    {
        await _blobContainer.SaveAsync(fileName, content, overrideExisting: true);
    }

    public async Task<byte[]> GetAsync(string fileName)
    {
        return await _blobContainer.GetAllBytesAsync(fileName);
    }
}
```

## Typed Container
```csharp
[BlobContainerName("profile-pictures")]
public class ProfilePictureContainer
{
}

// Inject typed container
public class MyService
{
    private readonly IBlobContainer<ProfilePictureContainer> _container;
}
```

## Configuration
```csharp
Configure<AbpBlobStoringOptions>(options =>
{
    options.Containers.ConfigureDefault(container =>
    {
        container.UseFileSystem(fs => fs.BasePath = "C:/MyFiles");
    });
});
```

